<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JULY 15.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JULY 15.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Tuesday were as follows.</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:     July 15     July 14   Dec 31 96    CHANGE</p>
<p>								 FROM YR-END</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  281.020     281.270     247.020   13.76 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  309.550     309.520     306.830    0.89 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  156.700     156.780     158.970   -1.43 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.396	46.372	47.182   -1.67 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  474.040     474.200     419.180   13.09 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  139.175     139.260     141.685   -1.77 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.129	16.152	16.185   -0.35 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  245.950     246.560     212.430   15.78 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.860	 1.861	 1.888   -1.48 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.553	 1.553	 1.581   -1.77 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  190.975     190.515     183.135    4.28 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
